                <p class="w-95 mb-0">The layout includes manholes, safety relief valves, and bottom or top discharge valves, ensuring leak-proof and pressure-regulated operations. With high durability, corrosion resistance, and global compatibility, ISO tankers are widely used in chemical logistics and international bulk liquid shipping.</p>
